<rml>
<head>
	<title>Remember Password Prompt</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="remember_password_prompt.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<!-- Legacy theme's canonical "remember password" confirmation. This is the theme-neutral
	     reference file (architecture-principles.md §15) -- themes/modern/remember_password_prompt.rml
	     forks it to add modern's own modern-frame/modern-frame-accent decoration (plus the
	     -crimson palette variant); keep both files' ids/data-model/event-callback names in sync,
	     RememberPasswordPrompt.cpp binds against both by the same names. center-both (2026-09-03)
	     replaces the old C++-computed centering -- see RememberPasswordPrompt.cpp's own comment. -->
	<div id="panel" class="center-both" data-model="remember_password_prompt">
		<div class="frame-accent"></div>
		<span class="prompt-title">{{title_text}}</span>
		<span class="prompt-body">{{body_text}}</span>
		<div class="btn btn-ok" data-event-click="prompt_ok_click">{{ok_label}}</div>
		<div class="btn btn-cancel" data-event-click="prompt_cancel_click">{{cancel_label}}</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
